   "source": [
    "### 8.1 什么是函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f705cef6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "- **函数**：一段带名字的代码块，用关键字 **def** 定义，包括函数名、参数列表、函数体。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "134f4b77",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 定义函数\n",
    "def greet_user(username):\n",
    "    print(f\"Hello, {username.title()}!\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# 调用函数\n",
    "greet_user('jesse')"
   ]
  }
